{
  "$schema": "https://o2csi.github.io/candeo/device-definition.schema.json",
  "name": "Alienware m18 R1",
  "notes": [
    "Survey: docs/protocol/alienware-m18-r1.md, section 1.",
    "An address is what the device calls a key, counting from one; a position is where it sits in the grid. Backspace is 36, not 34: two addresses in between drive nothing.",
    "Brightness takes effect only after a frame has been opened and closed (2026-09-18).",
    "Off is kind 01, a steady colour, given black: once the firmware animates, a black frame is overwritten within the second.",
    "Taking over sends that same Off when a host effect starts: an animating firmware redraws over every frame otherwise (2026-09-26).",
    "Sixteen kinds answer; these seven show something, watched one by one on 2026-09-18. Three take a colour.",
    "The firmware effects are named as the maker’s software lists them, so that someone coming from it finds what they know; 02 and 09, which it does not offer, keep the names of the lighting API they belong to."
  ],
  "match": { "vid": "0d62", "pid": "aab0", "usagePage": "ff89", "usage": "00cc" },
  "report": { "wire": "feature", "length": 64 },
  "frame": {
    "takeOver": ["cc 80 01 05 00 00 01 01 01 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 05"],
    "open": ["cc 94 00 00"],
    "each": { "chunk": 15, "send": ["cc 8c 02 00 {lights}"], "light": "{address} {r} {g} {b}" },
    "close": ["cc 93 00 00"]
  },
  "brightness": ["cc 94 00 00", "cc 93 00 00", "cc 83 38 9c {level}"],
  "firmware": {
    "send": "cc 80 {kind} 05 00 00 01 01 01 01 {r} {g} {b} {r2} {g2} {b2} 05",
    "off": "01",
    "effects": [
      {
        "id": "hardware:m18-01",
        "kind": "01",
        "colours": 1,
        "name": { "en": "Colour", "fr": "Couleur" },
        "summary": {
          "en": "One colour, held — the one chosen below.",
          "fr": "Une couleur, tenue — celle que vous choisissez ci-dessous."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "hardware:m18-02",
        "kind": "02",
        "colours": 1,
        "name": { "en": "Pulse", "fr": "Pulsation" },
        "summary": { "en": "That colour throbs, on and off, endlessly.", "fr": "Cette couleur bat, sans fin." }
      },
      {
        "id": "hardware:m18-03",
        "kind": "03",
        "colours": 0,
        "name": { "en": "Rainbow Wave", "fr": "Onde arc-en-ciel" },
        "summary": {
          "en": "A rainbow crosses the keyboard from side to side.",
          "fr": "Un arc-en-ciel traverse le clavier de part en part."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "hardware:m18-08",
        "kind": "08",
        "colours": 0,
        "name": { "en": "Breathing", "fr": "Respiration" },
        "summary": {
          "en": "Colours follow one another, fading through black in between.",
          "fr": "Les couleurs se succèdent, en passant par le noir entre chacune."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "hardware:m18-09",
        "kind": "09",
        "colours": 0,
        "name": "Morph",
        "summary": {
          "en": "Colours follow one another without ever going dark.",
          "fr": "Les couleurs se succèdent sans jamais s'éteindre."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "hardware:m18-0a",
        "kind": "0a",
        "colours": 1,
        "name": "Scanner",
        "summary": {
          "en": "A lit band sweeps across the keys and back.",
          "fr": "Une bande lumineuse traverse les touches et revient."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "hardware:m18-0e",
        "kind": "0e",
        "colours": 0,
        "name": { "en": "Spectrum", "fr": "Spectre" },
        "summary": {
          "en": "The whole keyboard cycles through hues, endlessly.",
          "fr": "Tout le clavier défile dans les teintes, sans fin."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
